1
00:00:54,393 --> 00:00:56,933
Thank you all for coming to our community meeting.  

2
00:00:56,933 --> 00:01:04,142
As you know, we are excited to unveil our improvement plan as we look forward to the influx of tourists in the summer months.

3
00:01:04,142 --> 00:01:14,965
I’ll start with a quick overview of the main points of interest in the area for anyone who may not quite know his or her way around yet, and then I’ll get into the improvements made.

4
00:01:15,665 --> 00:01:21,220
First off is my favorite, the Science Museum, which is on the corner of Saint George Road. 

5
00:01:21,220 --> 00:01:25,974
If you have not visited it yet, I encourage you to go before the busy season.

6
00:01:25,974 --> 00:01:31,514
It is absolutely spectacular - there is even a flight simulator you can try out!

7
00:01:31,514 --> 00:01:36,561
Just west of the Science Museum is the National History Museum.

8
00:01:36,561 --> 00:01:43,178
 It’s a site not to be missed as well, with each floor devoted to a different era in our nation’s history.

9
00:01:43,168 --> 00:01:48,873
There are special exhibits for children with interactive games and fun history lessons, too.

10
00:01:48,873 --> 00:01:57,080
If you’re looking for parking, it is available on the intersection of Queen Street and South King Street in the Car Park.

11
00:01:57,080 --> 00:02:00,594
Standard hourly and daily rates do apply.

12
00:02:00,594 --> 00:02:06,840
The best place for souvenirs is the Shopping Mall, though it gets extremely busy during peak times.

13
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:13,601
You can get there from the tube, or the entrance on Timber Road, just south of Cornwell Road.

14
00:02:13,601 --> 00:02:20,344
This area has students everywhere, usually from the Primary School across the street from the Shopping Mall.

15
00:02:20,344 --> 00:02:25,402
Classes often take field trips and engage in guided tours through the area.

16
00:02:25,402 --> 00:02:32,058
So that’s the overview of the main sites and hopefully by now I’ve given you a general idea of the area.


17
00:03:07,101 --> 00:03:16,173
Now I’m going to outline the improvements we have made in our efforts to make the experience even better for each and every one of our visitors.

18
00:03:16,173 --> 00:03:24,233
You probably noticed when you first drove into the Car Park this morning, that there is now additional signage to help avoid confusion.

19
00:03:24,233 --> 00:03:33,380
The directions were not entirely clear at first, so we have increased the number of one-way signs indicating the correct direction of traffic flow.

20
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:41,743
Not far from there, in line with our mission of giving back to the community, we constructed a brand new playground for the Primary School.

21
00:03:41,743 --> 00:03:51,875
 It is really something to be excited for - the equipment is state-of-the-art and includes swings, a small climbing wall, and even an obstacle course.

22
00:03:51,875 --> 00:03:56,472
Now we’ll head north and take a look at the Science Museum.

23
00:03:56,472 --> 00:04:13,123
In response to our feedback from past visitors to the museum, there is now free information available outlining not only upcoming IMAX showings, but also natural wonders like meteor showers, eclipses, and other cool natural events.

24
00:04:13,123 --> 00:04:19,455
The Science Museum isn’t the only Museum improving the experience of its visitors.

25
00:04:19,455 --> 00:04:35,017
The National History Museum has added an entire new wing to its facility to accommodate the large crowds of people gathering to see the Civil War exhibit, inventions timeline exhibit, and other wonderful sections of the museum.

26
00:04:35,017 --> 00:04:40,519
The increase in space will definitely give a more calm, comfortable experience for visitors.

27
00:04:40,519 --> 00:04:47,613
And finally, remember when there was actually a line at the mall entrance from the Tube Station?

28
00:04:47,613 --> 00:04:54,142
It was terrible trying to get anywhere from the Tube because foot traffic got so backed up sometimes.

29
00:04:54,142 --> 00:05:01,984
We have addressed that by adding another entry point into the mall from the other end of the platform to disperse the crowd.

30
00:05:01,984 --> 00:05:05,918
So those are the major improvements we have made.

31
00:05:05,918 --> 00:05:19,199
Clearly having too many people that want to visit and enjoy what our community has to offer the public is a good problem to have, and I am confident that we have made the changes necessary to accommodate the growing interest in the area.

32
00:05:19,199 --> 00:05:25,283
As always, we welcome any questions, comments, or concerns about the new improvements plan.

33
00:05:25,283 --> 00:05:35,609
In a few minutes I will open up the floor for questions but you can also contact me or any other board member by email or through the city website. 

34
00:05:35,599 --> 00:05:43,433
Thank you for coming, and I now encourage you to stay for the Questions and Answers panel occurring between now and 10.30... 